    "patterns": [
      { "label": "Fixed line (0549 …)", "national": "0549 XXXXXX", "international": "+378 0549 XXXXXX" },
      { "label": "Mobile (6…)", "national": "6X XXX XXX", "international": "+378 6X XXX XXX" }
    ],
    "examples": [
      { "type": "fixed-line", "e164": "+3780549123456", "international": "+378 0549 123456", "national": "0549 123456", "note": "Fixed line — 0549 is the Italian area code San Marino incorporates" },
      { "type": "fixed-line", "e164": "+390549123456", "international": "+39 0549 123456", "national": "0549 123456", "note": "The same subscriber reached through the Italian country code +39" },
      { "type": "mobile", "e164": "+37861234567", "international": "+378 61 23 45 67", "national": "61 23 45 67", "note": "Mobile — the 6 range, 8 digits" }
    ],
    "notes": [
      "San Marino is dual-routed: it holds country code +378 but is also reachable through Italy as +39 0549 xxxxxx, because it is embedded in the Italian numbering plan.",
      "All digits are always dialled; there is no trunk prefix. The leading 0 of 0549 is part of the number itself — as in Italy, it is retained when dialling from abroad.",
      "Leading digits 0/8/9 denote landlines, 6 mobile, 5 IP telephony and 7 premium services."
    ],
    "sources": [
      "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Telephone_numbers_in_San_Marino",
      "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Telephone_numbers_in_Italy"
